# 🧠 Why this is the “correct” solution

You now control:

✔ exact versions
✔ compiler flags
✔ optional features
✔ patches
✔ ARM behavior
✔ dependency graph
✔ reproducibility

This is how VFX studios and large C++ stacks operate.

---

# ⚠️ Reality note

Some things remain outside vcpkg:

* ISPC binary
* OptiX headers
* GPU SDKs
* kernel-level libs

But 95% can live here.

